<section class="container section-spacing video-page">
  <header class="music-page__head">
    <div>
      <div class="music-page__overline"><span class="music-page__signal" aria-hidden="true"></span> LIVE SESSION <span class="music-page__overline-sep">/</span> ВИДЕО СТРИМА</div>
      <h1>Заказ видео</h1>
      <p class="music-page__lead">Какое видео идёт на стриме прямо сейчас и очередь заказов. Страница обновляется сама — звук идёт на стриме.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  {{#unless available}}<p class="form-notice form-notice--error" role="alert">Заказ видео временно недоступен.</p>{{/unless}}

  <div class="video-accepting" id="video-accepting" role="status"><i aria-hidden="true"></i><span id="video-accepting-text">Уточняем статус приёма заказов…</span></div>

  <section class="video-hero" id="video-hero" aria-label="Сейчас идёт">
    <div class="video-hero__art-wrap" id="video-hero-art-wrap">
      <span class="video-hero__art-fallback" id="video-hero-fallback" aria-hidden="true">▶</span>
      <img class="video-hero__art" id="video-hero-art" alt="" hidden />
    </div>
    <div class="video-hero__meta">
      <span class="music-chip video-hero__status-chip" id="video-hero-status-chip" hidden></span>
      <a class="video-hero__title" id="video-hero-title" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" hidden></a>
      <div class="video-hero__empty" id="video-hero-empty">
        <div><strong>Сейчас ничего не идёт</strong><span>Закажи видео — кинь ссылку в чат или напиши <code>!video &lt;ссылка&gt;</code></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="video-hero__chips" id="video-hero-chips" hidden></div>
      <div class="video-hero__requester" id="video-hero-requester" hidden></div>
      <div class="music-progress" id="video-hero-progress" hidden>
        <span class="music-progress__time" id="video-hero-pos">0:00</span>
        <span class="music-bar"><span class="music-bar__fill" id="video-hero-fill"></span></span>
        <span class="music-progress__time" id="video-hero-len">0:00</span>
      </div>
      <div class="video-votes" id="video-votes" hidden></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="video-queue" aria-label="Очередь заказов">
    <div class="music-queue__head">
      <div><span class="music-section-kicker">СЛЕДУЮЩИЕ</span><h2>Очередь</h2></div>
      <span class="music-queue__count" id="video-queue-count"></span>
    </div>
    <ol class="video-queue__list" id="video-queue-list"></ol>
    <p class="empty-state" id="video-queue-empty">Очередь пуста — закажи видео ссылкой в чате.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="music-howto" aria-label="Как заказать видео" style="margin-top: 32px">
    <h2>Как заказать видео</h2>
    <div class="music-howto__grid">
      <article class="music-howto__card music-howto__card--primary">
        <code class="music-howto__cmd">!video &lt;ссылка&gt;</code>
        <p>Заказать видео — или просто кинь ссылку в чат, пока приём открыт. YouTube, Shorts, TikTok, клипы Twitch и другие площадки.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="music-howto__card music-howto__card--paid">
        <code class="music-howto__cmd">Донат со ссылкой на видео</code>
        <p>Пока приём открыт, донат со ссылкой идёт в очередь видео и имеет приоритет. Донат с <code>!sr</code> всегда идёт в музыку.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="music-howto__list">
      <div class="music-howto__row"><code class="music-howto__cmd music-howto__cmd--inline">!wrongvideo</code><span>Заказал не то видео? Убери свой последний заказ, пока он в очереди.</span></div>
      <div class="music-howto__row"><code class="music-howto__cmd music-howto__cmd--inline">!vskip</code><span>Модераторы пропускают видео сразу, остальные — голосуют за скип.</span></div>
      <div class="music-howto__row"><code class="music-howto__cmd music-howto__cmd--inline">скип / оставить</code><span>Голосование: напиши слово «скип» или «оставить» первым словом сообщения в чат.</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</section>

<style>
  .video-page .video-accepting { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; padding: .55rem 1rem; border-radius: 999px; font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 700; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--panel-border); color: var(--text-soft); }
  .video-page .video-accepting i { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--muted); }
  .video-page .video-accepting.is-open { border-color: rgba(134, 239, 172, .4); background: var(--success-soft); color: #86efac; }
  .video-page .video-accepting.is-open i { background: #86efac; box-shadow: 0 0 10px #86efac; }
  .video-page .video-accepting.is-closed i { background: #fca5a5; }

  .video-page .video-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 260px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 1.6rem; align-items: center; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: rgba(14, 14, 18, .82); border: 1px solid var(--panel-border); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
  .video-page .video-hero__art-wrap { position: relative; width: 260px; height: 146px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: var(--radius-md); overflow: hidden; background: #000; }
  .video-page .video-hero__art-wrap.is-vertical { width: 150px; height: 260px; }
  .video-page .video-hero__art { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }
  .video-page .video-hero__art-fallback { color: var(--muted); font-size: 2rem; }
  .video-page .video-hero__meta { display: grid; gap: .6rem; justify-items: start; min-width: 0; }
  .video-page .video-hero__status-chip { text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; font-size: .68rem; }
  .video-page .video-hero.is-playing .video-hero__status-chip { background: var(--success-soft); color: #86efac; }
  .video-page .video-hero__title { color: var(--text); font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.6vw, 1.7rem); line-height: 1.25; text-decoration: none; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .video-page .video-hero__title:hover { color: var(--primary-bright); }
  .video-page .video-hero__empty div { display: grid; gap: .25rem; color: var(--text-soft); }
  .video-page .video-hero__empty strong { color: var(--text); font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .video-page .video-hero__empty span { font-size: .88rem; }
  .video-page .video-hero__chips, .video-page .video-hero__requester { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: .4rem; }
  .video-page .video-hero__requester { color: var(--text-soft); font-size: .9rem; }
  .video-page .video-hero__requester .video-hero__co { color: var(--muted); }
  .video-page .video-hero__amount { color: #fbbf24; font-weight: 700; }
  .video-page .video-hero__meta .music-progress { max-width: none; }

  .video-page .video-votes { display: grid; gap: .4rem; padding: .7rem .9rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .05); border: 1px solid var(--panel-border); font-size: .85rem; color: var(--text-soft); }
  .video-page .video-votes__counts { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; }
  .video-page .video-votes__skip { color: #fca5a5; font-weight: 700; }
  .video-page .video-votes__keep { color: #86efac; font-weight: 700; }
  .video-page .video-votes__needed { color: var(--muted); }
  .video-page .video-votes__words { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: .35rem; }
  .video-page .video-votes__label { color: var(--muted); }
  .video-page .video-votes__word { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: .1em .55em; border-radius: 999px; font-size: .82em; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .14); }
  .video-page .video-votes__emote { height: 22px; width: auto; vertical-align: middle; }
  .video-page .video-votes__warning { color: #fbbf24; font-weight: 700; }

  .video-page .video-queue { margin-top: 2rem; }
  .video-page .video-queue__list { list-style: none; display: grid; gap: .5rem; }
  .video-page .video-queue__item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 24px 96px minmax(0, 1fr) auto; align-items: center; gap: .9rem; padding: .55rem .8rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--panel-border); }
  .video-page .video-queue__item.is-paid { border-color: rgba(255, 179, 0, .35); }
  .video-page .video-queue__num { color: var(--muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-size: .85rem; }
  .video-page .video-queue__art-wrap { position: relative; width: 96px; height: 54px; border-radius: var(--radius-xs); overflow: hidden; background: #000; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .video-page .video-queue__art-wrap.is-vertical { width: 40px; }
  .video-page .video-queue__art { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }
  .video-page .video-queue__art-fallback { color: var(--muted); }
  .video-page .video-queue__info { display: grid; gap: .2rem; min-width: 0; }
  .video-page .video-queue__title { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .video-page .video-queue__title:hover { color: var(--primary-bright); }
  .video-page .video-queue__meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: .4rem; color: var(--text-soft); font-size: .82rem; }
  .video-page .video-queue__amount { color: #fbbf24; font-weight: 700; }
  .video-page .video-queue__right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem; color: var(--text-soft); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-size: .85rem; }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .video-page .video-hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; justify-items: start; }
    .video-page .video-hero__art-wrap, .video-page .video-hero__art-wrap.is-vertical { width: 180px; height: 101px; }
    .video-page .video-queue__item { grid-template-columns: 18px 64px minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .video-page .video-queue__art-wrap { width: 64px; height: 36px; }
    .video-page .video-queue__art-wrap.is-vertical { width: 28px; }
    .video-page .video-queue__right { grid-column: 3; }
  }
</style>

<script src="/js/music-client.js"></script>
<script>
  (function () {
    'use strict';
    var root = document.getElementById('video-hero');
    if (!root) return;
    var el = function (id) { return document.getElementById(id); };
    var els = {
      hero: root, artWrap: el('video-hero-art-wrap'), art: el('video-hero-art'), fallback: el('video-hero-fallback'),
      statusChip: el('video-hero-status-chip'), title: el('video-hero-title'), empty: el('video-hero-empty'),
      chips: el('video-hero-chips'), requester: el('video-hero-requester'), progress: el('video-hero-progress'),
      pos: el('video-hero-pos'), len: el('video-hero-len'), fill: el('video-hero-fill'),
      votes: el('video-votes'), accepting: el('video-accepting'), acceptingText: el('video-accepting-text'),
      queueList: el('video-queue-list'), queueEmpty: el('video-queue-empty'), queueCount: el('video-queue-count'),
    };
    var lastId = null;

    function chip(className, text) {
      var span = document.createElement('span');
      span.className = className;
      span.textContent = text;
      return span;
    }

    function requesterRow(node, item) {
      var name = document.createElement('span');
      name.textContent = item.requestedBy ? '@' + item.requestedBy : 'Стример';
      node.appendChild(name);
      if (item.coRequesters && item.coRequesters.length) {
        var co = chip('video-hero__co', '+' + item.coRequesters.length);
        co.title = item.coRequesters.join(', ');
        node.appendChild(co);
      }
      if (item.isPaid && item.amountLabel) node.appendChild(chip('video-hero__amount', '\uD83D\uDCB0 ' + item.amountLabel));
      return node;
    }

    function renderAccepting(state) {
      if (!state) return;
      els.accepting.classList.toggle('is-open', Boolean(state.accepting));
      els.accepting.classList.toggle('is-closed', !state.accepting);
      els.acceptingText.textContent = state.accepting
        ? 'Приём заказов открыт — кидайте ссылку в чат'
        : 'Приём заказов закрыт';
    }

    function wordChip(word) {
      var span = document.createElement('span');
      span.className = 'video-votes__word';
      if (word && word.url) {
        var img = document.createElement('img');
        img.className = 'video-votes__emote';
        img.src = word.url;
        img.alt = word.word;
        img.loading = 'lazy';
        span.appendChild(img);
      } else {
        span.textContent = word && word.word ? word.word : '';
      }
      return span;
    }

    function wordsRow(label, words) {
      if (!words || !words.length) return null;
      var row = document.createElement('div');
      row.className = 'video-votes__words';
      row.appendChild(chip('video-votes__label', label));
      words.forEach(function (word) { row.appendChild(wordChip(word)); });
      return row;
    }

    function renderVotes(state) {
      var v = state && state.votes;
      if (!v || !v.enabled || !state.current) { els.votes.hidden = true; return; }
      els.votes.textContent = '';
      if (state.warning && state.warning.endsAt) {
        var left = Math.max(0, Math.ceil((state.warning.endsAt - Date.now()) / 1000));
        els.votes.appendChild(chip('video-votes__warning', state.warning.reason === 'paid' ? 'Кончилось оплаченное время — видео пропускается через ' + left + ' сек' : 'Голоса набраны — видео пропускается через ' + left + ' сек'));
      } else if (v.blocked === 'paid') {
        els.votes.appendChild(chip('video-votes__label', 'Донатное видео нельзя пропустить голосованием.'));
      } else if (v.blocked === 'locked') {
        els.votes.appendChild(chip('video-votes__label', 'Голосование закрыто.'));
      } else {
        var counts = document.createElement('div');
        counts.className = 'video-votes__counts';
        counts.appendChild(chip('video-votes__skip', 'скип ' + v.skip));
        counts.appendChild(chip('video-votes__keep', 'оставить ' + v.keep));
        counts.appendChild(chip('video-votes__needed', '· нужно преимущество ' + v.needed));
        if (v.opensAt) counts.appendChild(chip('video-votes__label', '· голосование откроется через ' + Math.max(0, Math.ceil((v.opensAt - Date.now()) / 1000)) + ' сек'));
        els.votes.appendChild(counts);
      }
      var skipRow = wordsRow('Скип:', v.skipWords);
      var keepRow = wordsRow('Оставить:', v.keepWords);
      if (skipRow) els.votes.appendChild(skipRow);
      if (keepRow) els.votes.appendChild(keepRow);
      els.votes.hidden = !(els.votes.childNodes.length);
    }

    function render(state) {
      if (!state) return;
      renderAccepting(state);
      var item = state.current;
      els.hero.classList.toggle('is-playing', Boolean(item) && state.status === 'playing');
      if (!item) {
        lastId = null;
        els.title.hidden = true;
        els.chips.hidden = true;
        els.requester.hidden = true;
        els.progress.hidden = true;
        els.empty.hidden = false;
        els.statusChip.hidden = true;
        els.votes.hidden = true;
        return;
      }
      els.empty.hidden = true;
      els.title.hidden = false;
      els.chips.hidden = false;
      els.requester.hidden = false;
      els.statusChip.hidden = false;
      els.statusChip.textContent = state.status === 'playing' ? 'Играет' : (state.status === 'waiting' ? 'Скоро следующее' : 'Пауза');
      if (item.id !== lastId) {
        lastId = item.id;
        els.title.textContent = item.title || 'Без названия';
        if (item.url) els.title.href = item.url;
        else els.title.removeAttribute('href');
        els.chips.textContent = '';
        if (item.providerLabel) els.chips.appendChild(chip('music-chip', item.providerLabel));
        if (item.kindLabel && item.kindLabel !== item.providerLabel && item.kindLabel !== 'Видео') els.chips.appendChild(chip('music-chip', item.kindLabel));
        els.requester.textContent = '';
        requesterRow(els.requester, item);
        if (item.thumbnail) {
          els.art.src = item.thumbnail;
          els.art.hidden = false;
          els.fallback.hidden = true;
        } else {
          els.art.hidden = true;
          els.art.removeAttribute('src');
          els.fallback.hidden = false;
        }
        els.artWrap.classList.toggle('is-vertical', Boolean(item.isVertical));
        els.len.textContent = item.playSec ? MusicClient.formatTime(item.playSec) : '—';
        els.progress.hidden = false;
      }
      renderVotes(state);
    }

    function renderQueue(queue) {
      var items = Array.isArray(queue) ? queue : [];
      els.queueList.textContent = '';
      items.forEach(function (item, index) {
        var li = document.createElement('li');
        li.className = 'video-queue__item' + (item.isPaid ? ' is-paid' : '');

        var num = document.createElement('span');
        num.className = 'video-queue__num';
        num.textContent = String(index + 1);

        var artWrap = document.createElement('span');
        artWrap.className = 'video-queue__art-wrap' + (item.isVertical ? ' is-vertical' : '');
        var fallback = document.createElement('span');
        fallback.className = 'video-queue__art-fallback';
        fallback.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
        fallback.textContent = '▶';
        var art = document.createElement('img');
        art.className = 'video-queue__art';
        art.alt = '';
        art.loading = 'lazy';
        if (item.thumbnail) art.src = item.thumbnail;
        else art.hidden = true;
        art.addEventListener('error', function () { art.hidden = true; });
        artWrap.appendChild(fallback);
        artWrap.appendChild(art);

        var info = document.createElement('div');
        info.className = 'video-queue__info';
        var title = document.createElement(item.url ? 'a' : 'span');
        title.className = 'video-queue__title';
        title.textContent = item.title || 'Без названия';
        if (item.url) { title.href = item.url; title.target = '_blank'; title.rel = 'noreferrer'; }
        var meta = document.createElement('div');
        meta.className = 'video-queue__meta';
        var requester = document.createElement('span');
        requester.textContent = item.requestedBy ? '@' + item.requestedBy : 'Стример';
        meta.appendChild(requester);
        if (item.coRequesters && item.coRequesters.length) {
          var co = document.createElement('span');
          co.textContent = '+' + item.coRequesters.length;
          co.title = item.coRequesters.join(', ');
          meta.appendChild(co);
        }
        if (item.providerLabel) meta.appendChild(chip('music-chip', item.providerLabel));
        if (item.kindLabel && item.kindLabel !== item.providerLabel && item.kindLabel !== 'Видео') meta.appendChild(chip('music-chip', item.kindLabel));
        if (item.isPaid) meta.appendChild(chip('music-chip music-chip--paid', 'Донат'));
        if (item.isPaid && item.amountLabel) meta.appendChild(chip('video-queue__amount', '\uD83D\uDCB0 ' + item.amountLabel));
        info.appendChild(title);
        info.appendChild(meta);

        var right = document.createElement('span');
        right.className = 'video-queue__right';
        var dur = document.createElement('span');
        dur.textContent = item.playLabel || (item.playSec ? MusicClient.formatTime(item.playSec) : '—');
        right.appendChild(dur);

        li.appendChild(num);
        li.appendChild(artWrap);
        li.appendChild(info);
        li.appendChild(right);
        els.queueList.appendChild(li);
      });
      els.queueEmpty.hidden = items.length > 0;
      var state = client.getState();
      var info = state && state.queueInfo;
      var countText = items.length + ' видео';
      if (info && info.totalSec > 0) countText += ' · ~' + Math.max(1, Math.round(info.totalSec / 60)) + ' мин';
      els.queueCount.textContent = countText;
    }

    function tick() {
      var state = client.getState();
      var item = state && state.current;
      if (item) {
        var total = Number(item.playSec) || 0;
        var elapsed = Math.max(0, client.position() - (Number(item.startSec) || 0));
        els.pos.textContent = MusicClient.formatTime(elapsed);
        els.fill.style.width = (total > 0 ? Math.min(100, (elapsed / total) * 100) : 0) + '%';
        if (state.warning && state.warning.endsAt) renderVotes(state);
      }
      requestAnimationFrame(tick);
    }

    var client = MusicClient.connect({
      namespace: 'video',
      initial: {{{initialJson}}},
      websocketPort: '{{websocketPort}}',
      onState: render,
      onQueue: renderQueue,
    });
    requestAnimationFrame(tick);
  })();
</script>
